<p>Spit poison at your target, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100,<br>Dexterity 100">199, 273, 330, 378, 420</acronym> poison damage over six turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Strength or Dexterity (whichever is higher).</p>